    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> \u58a8\u7b14\u6597\u5996\u4f20 Inkbrush: The Demon Wars</strong> is a 2D turn-based strategy game where you command a team led by a young inkbrush warrior and his companions. Explore a scroll-like world inspired by Chinese mythology, filled with ancient secrets and mythical creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather materials during battles to craft gear and items, strengthen your team, and unlock diverse skill trees for deep tactical customization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Tactical Combat \u00d7 Environmental Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use terrain and environmental elements to gain advantages and deal unique effects in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/410a31d6fbb5a31dc3825eb2a677fb23.poster.avif?t=1752829778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/410a31d6fbb5a31dc3825eb2a677fb23.webm?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/410a31d6fbb5a31dc3825eb2a677fb23.mp4?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf3f Skill Trees &amp; Team Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a variety of skills, nurture each character\u2019s growth, and create your own unique combat style and party composition.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/8eebd1e43b6a4c7811b4deb4da681cbe.poster.avif?t=1752829778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/8eebd1e43b6a4c7811b4deb4da681cbe.webm?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/8eebd1e43b6a4c7811b4deb4da681cbe.mp4?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2692\ufe0f On-Battle Resource Gathering \u00d7 Crafting System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources mid-battle and forge powerful equipment afterward to prepare for tougher encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc32 Intense Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge fearsome bosses with high health and complex skills. Test your planning, adaptability, and tactics under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Linear Map Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance through a hand-painted world like an unfolding scroll, triggering battles, events, and hidden rewards along the way.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/a97bd1355539d5ed2880d7d5bbff5389.poster.avif?t=1752829778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/a97bd1355539d5ed2880d7d5bbff5389.webm?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/a97bd1355539d5ed2880d7d5bbff5389.mp4?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 Stylized Ink Art \u00d7 Traditional Instrumental Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blending cartoony aesthetics with ink painting inspiration, paired with guqin and bamboo flute melodies to bring an immersive Eastern fantasy atmosphere.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> \u58a8\u7b14\u6597\u5996\u4f20 Inkbrush: The Demon Wars</strong> is a 2D turn-based strategy game where you command a team led by a young inkbrush warrior and his companions. Explore a scroll-like world inspired by Chinese mythology, filled with ancient secrets and mythical creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather materials during battles to craft gear and items, strengthen your team, and unlock diverse skill trees for deep tactical customization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Tactical Combat \u00d7 Environmental Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use terrain and environmental elements to gain advantages and deal unique effects in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/410a31d6fbb5a31dc3825eb2a677fb23.poster.avif?t=1752829778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/410a31d6fbb5a31dc3825eb2a677fb23.webm?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/410a31d6fbb5a31dc3825eb2a677fb23.mp4?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf3f Skill Trees &amp; Team Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a variety of skills, nurture each character\u2019s growth, and create your own unique combat style and party composition.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/8eebd1e43b6a4c7811b4deb4da681cbe.poster.avif?t=1752829778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/8eebd1e43b6a4c7811b4deb4da681cbe.webm?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/8eebd1e43b6a4c7811b4deb4da681cbe.mp4?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2692\ufe0f On-Battle Resource Gathering \u00d7 Crafting System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources mid-battle and forge powerful equipment afterward to prepare for tougher encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc32 Intense Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge fearsome bosses with high health and complex skills. Test your planning, adaptability, and tactics under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Linear Map Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance through a hand-painted world like an unfolding scroll, triggering battles, events, and hidden rewards along the way.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/a97bd1355539d5ed2880d7d5bbff5389.poster.avif?t=1752829778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/a97bd1355539d5ed2880d7d5bbff5389.webm?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597600/extras/a97bd1355539d5ed2880d7d5bbff5389.mp4?t=1752829778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 Stylized Ink Art \u00d7 Traditional Instrumental Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blending cartoony aesthetics with ink painting inspiration, paired with guqin and bamboo flute melodies to bring an immersive Eastern fantasy atmosphere.</p>",
